        "created_at": "2019-05-06T13:09:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'd suggest going for a blight card, or using Brandenburg-Prussia as an adversary. They don't really do much to concentrate on, just speed up the process. You could probably do both without having too much trouble. Or use more complex spirits.</p>",
