        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-05-06T14:24:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That does sound thematically impressive -- glad you got to play that out!&nbsp;</p>\n<p>We went to the higher complexity spirits and played with those until we were comfortable. Adversaries were next.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>If you're going to try a core set blight card, I'd recommend just doing that, first. (No offense, pwatson. ;-)&nbsp;When that card flips, it will really change the game and difficulty increases signficantly! (The core set blight cards are, in my opinion, the hardest of the blight cards. :-( )&nbsp;</p>",
